--- !u!114 &1886034858
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1886034857}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2615db14a1d2c0242bf6203df68e484e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: Werm
        icon: {fileID: 960052986, guid: 344fd486831103f48a551cf762b3130f, type: 3}
      line: Well, that could've gone better.
    - character:
        name: MIDAS
        icon: {fileID: -783927400, guid: bae5dede37173f546b64e13438e30869, type: 3}
      line: Hmmm, indeed. It seems this planet has been frozen over for quite some
        time.
    - character:
        name: Werm
        icon: {fileID: 960052986, guid: 344fd486831103f48a551cf762b3130f, type: 3}
      line: You don't say?
    - character:
        name: MIDAS
        icon: {fileID: -783927400, guid: bae5dede37173f546b64e13438e30869, type: 3}
      line: We will need to make necessary repairs to the ship before we can continue
        our mission.
    - character:
        name: Werm
        icon: {fileID: 960052986, guid: 344fd486831103f48a551cf762b3130f, type: 3}
      line: I know.
    - character:
        name: MIDAS
        icon: {fileID: -1059489668, guid: e34f702a95cc57040ab2bc228a79edf1, type: 3}
      line: ...
    - character:
        name: Werm
        icon: {fileID: 403211880, guid: 48d3dc5a54c12104192c20ddcde8701d, type: 3}
      line: What are you doing?
    - character:
        name: MIDAS
        icon: {fileID: 1519617294, guid: b22a9074181d47d4287d37e82b2274a7, type: 3}
      line: I have done a scan of our landscape; it appears there is a structure
        within our perimeter.
    - character:
        name: MIDAS
        icon: {fileID: -783927400, guid: bae5dede37173f546b64e13438e30869, type: 3}
      line: Though I cannot gauge an accurate distance due to the intense cold.
    - character:
        name: Werm
        icon: {fileID: 403211880, guid: 48d3dc5a54c12104192c20ddcde8701d, type: 3}
      line: You think they'll have what we need?
    - character:
        name: MIDAS
        icon: {fileID: -783927400, guid: bae5dede37173f546b64e13438e30869, type: 3}
      line: Upon entering the atmosphere, I had picked up several scans of usable
        material throughout the area
    - character:
        name: Werm
        icon: {fileID: 960052986, guid: 344fd486831103f48a551cf762b3130f, type: 3}
      line: ...
    - character:
        name: MIDAS
        icon: {fileID: -783927400, guid: bae5dede37173f546b64e13438e30869, type: 3}
      line: In other words, yes. I should be able to simulate pathing options in
        order to reach your destinations.
    - character:
        name: MIDAS
        icon: {fileID: 1519617294, guid: b22a9074181d47d4287d37e82b2274a7, type: 3}
      line: These should allow your traversal to be simpler, given the weather here
        stays favorable.
    - character:
        name: Werm
        icon: {fileID: 867931486, guid: 94e40c6990e9ab14bb1b3301c497caf2, type: 3}
      line: Ok well let's get going then. I'm freezing my ass off.
    - character:
        name: MIDAS
        icon: {fileID: -1940142591, guid: c5d0808fcd86a0b4ca466f925a8b1ba4, type: 3}
      line: If your condition is already this bad, you might not be able to make
        it to the colony.
    - character:
        name: Werm
        icon: {fileID: 960052986, guid: 344fd486831103f48a551cf762b3130f, type: 3}
      line: It's a figure of speech...
    - character:
        name: MIDAS
        icon: {fileID: 607143691, guid: 94995c5cfec37de40b95254a461303d3, type: 3}
      line: Oh, well then. Let us continue.
